    "scr_dup": "003",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>Written&nbsp;Exam: 20%</div>\n\n<div>Final Oral Presentation: 20%</div>\n\n<div>Extensive Reading: 20%</div>\n\n<div>Course work/In-class activities: 30%</div>\n\n<div>Attendance: 10%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>Midterm Exam: 25%</div>\n\n<div>Final Oral Presentation: 25%</div>\n\n<div>Attendance: 10%</div>\n\n<div>Course work/In-class activities: 40%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "1. Be on time. 請準時上課。\n2. Participate in the class discussion and class activities. 請參與課堂討論及課堂活動。\n3. Students must submit a leave application to the school in advance, stating the reason for the leave and the expected duration.學生必須提前向學校提交請假申請，說明請假的原因和預計時間。",
